OL,3,GNEWSAMan denies lying after
OL,4,Astepfather's death
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man accused of perverting the course
OL,7,Fof justice following his stepfather's
OL,8,Fdeath has denied lying to police and
OL,9,Fparamedics about the circumstances in
OL,10,Fwhich the body was found.
OL,12,FAlberto Bukala, 22, is on trial
OL,13,Falongside his mother, Sylwia Bukala,
OL,14,F43, following the death of 41-year-old
OL,15,FKarol Likiera at a flat in Algitha
OL,16,FRoad, Skegness, on 18 August 2025.
OL,18,FHis mother admits stabbing Likiera but
OL,19,Fdenies murder, claiming diminished
OL,20,Fresponsibility due to her mental state.
OL,23,APub: 30-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,387,380,200,160,0,100
