OL,3,GNEWSAMan denies lying after
OL,4,Astepfather's death
OL,5,
OL,6,FProsecutors allege Alberto Bukala would
OL,7,Fhave seen his stepfather's body when he
OL,8,Freturned from work during the early
OL,9,Fhours and later gave a false account to
OL,10,Fthe emergency services.
